          "text": "Reported systemic symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Felt hot and cold during the first 2 days; no fevers in the last 48 hours, no rigors, and no confusion. Appetite decreased; drinking adequately."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
